{"reviewId": "35379263_847bpu7pq", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "把黄金价格除以原油价格，得到“黄金能买多少桶原油”。这一比值在 10～15 之间波动，低于 10 说明黄金便宜、高于 15 说明黄金昂贵", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "除此之外，黄金作为康波中的货币，对其购买力的检验依据其相对于其他大宗商品的价格比率。在这方面，黄金-原油价格比率是被广泛应用的指标", "range": "24623-24688", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "35379263_847bpu7pq", "userVid": 35379263, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761215359, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 35379263, "name": "nevica🍀", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKpjDGPOEqkU8QLzmE2meW6NJqjhXuztfoeC8H1Adj8B130vicm3qrXPPPDrY25rY4rdkVX7aMHBGtm5MFzCFqD4ZcX8G80z3JoMD4EWnrXa0w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-50", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 50}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 16, "likes": [{"userVid": 388992702, "name": "空空", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-esT6aeepHjHJIjVQm5LKge3/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "空空", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "学生", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "35379263_847bpu7pq", "content": "2026年6月9日的最新市场数据，黄金与原油的比率（金油比）约为 47.5，即一盎司黄金当前可以兑换大约47-48桶原油", "commentId": "35379263_847bpu7pq_c253631353_89J3SlDSK",